"The cells in this section represent different items that the end-user can select from, and they","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"are generated from NSStrings in its items array. Once a cell is selected, a checkmark appears next","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to it, similar to Apple’s Settings application where a user selects a Ringtone for their","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"iPhone. The section can be configured to allow multiple selection and to allow no selection at all.","type":"text"}],"references":{"doc://ie.dgapps.STV/documentation/STV/SCArrayOfStringsSection":{"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"SCArrayOfStringsSection","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV\/SCArrayOfStringsSection","title":"SCArrayOfStringsSection","url":"\/documentation\/stv\/scarrayofstringssection","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"This class functions as an SCTableViewModel section that is able to represent an array"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of string items and automatically generate its cells from these items. The class inherits"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"all its funtionality from its superclass: SCArrayOfItemsSection, except that its items"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"array can only contain items of type NSString."}]},"doc://ie.dgapps.STV/documentation/STV/SCSelectionSection/maximumSelections-c.ivar":{"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"maximumSelections","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/ie.dgapps.STV\/documentation\/STV\/SCSelectionSection\/maximumSelections-c.ivar","type":"topic","title":"maximumSelections","url":"\/documentation\/stv\/scselectionsection\/maximumselections-c.ivar","abstract":[{"text":"The maximum number of items that can be selected. Set to zero to allow an infinite number of selections. Default: 0.","type":"text"}]},"doc://ie.dgap